; Five cards a segment in (pc, kind, ts, te, nxtpc), five out: the filters of the segment's sounding frames, ma
; and mb (they glide from ma to mb by u when uon is 1, a vowel), vm (voiced) and gl (glides at the ends). A vowel,
; sonorant, nasal or HH speaks through its own targets, ts to te, with glides; HH unvoiced. A fricative or
; affricate through its noise filter (NOISE), voiced as the table says (VOICED); a stop's burst through NOISE,
; unvoiced, or through its back form (ALT) when it has one and the next sound is a back vowel (BACK of row nxtpc,
; OUT at askb). The table's cards VOICED NOISE ALT come from OUT at ask.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   pc       03-18: a segment; a pause: nothing
  04                    INP   kind
  05                    INP   ts
  06                    INP   te
  07                    INP   nxtpc
  08                    CLA   z
  09                    STO   ma
  10                    STO   mb
  11                    STO   uon
  12                    STO   gl
  13                    CLA   00
  14                    STO   vm
  15                    CLA   kind
  16                    SUB   c8
  17                    TAC   snd
  18                    JMP   out
  19            snd     CLA   kind     19-40: own targets: a vowel, a sonorant, a nasal, HH
  20                    SUB   n4
  21                    TAC   own
  22                    SUB   n3
  23                    TAC   ask
  24            own     CLA   ts
  25                    STO   ma
  26                    CLA   te
  27                    STO   mb
  28                    CLA   00
  29                    STO   gl
  30                    CLA   kind
  31                    SUB   n2
  32                    TAC   vow
  33                    SUB   n5
  34                    TAC   out
  35                    CLA   z
  36                    STO   vm
  37                    JMP   out
  38            vow     CLA   00
  39                    STO   uon
  40                    JMP   out
  41            ask     OUT   pc       41-66: an obstruent's noise, a stop's back form
  42            gv      INP   voiced
  43            gn      INP   noise
  44            ga      INP   alt
  45                    CLA   noise
  46                    STO   ma
  47                    STO   mb
  48                    CLA   voiced
  49                    STO   vm
  50                    CLA   kind
  51                    SUB   n5
  52                    TAC   stop
  53                    JMP   out
  54            stop    CLA   z
  55                    STO   vm
  56                    CLA   alt
  57                    SUB   00
  58                    TAC   out
  59            askb    OUT   nxtpc
  60            gb      INP   back
  61                    CLA   back
  62                    SUB   00
  63                    TAC   out
  64                    CLA   alt
  65                    STO   ma
  66                    STO   mb
  67            out     OUT   ma       67-92: the five cards
  68                    OUT   mb
  69                    OUT   uon
  70                    OUT   vm
  71                    OUT   gl
  72                    JMP   rec
  73            pc      DATA  0
  74            kind    DATA  0
  75            ts      DATA  0
  76            te      DATA  0
  77            nxtpc   DATA  0
  78            ma      DATA  0
  79            mb      DATA  0
  80            uon     DATA  0
  81            vm      DATA  0
  82            gl      DATA  0
  83            voiced  DATA  0
  84            noise   DATA  0
  85            alt     DATA  0
  86            back    DATA  0
  87            z       DATA  0
  88            c8      DATA  8
  89            n4      DATA  4
  90            n3      DATA  3
  91            n2      DATA  2
  92            n5      DATA  5
